{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/c9bac5b7493de380051733df3045d87e.avif?t=1768888574\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 About this Game</h2>Just another ordinary commute, or so you thought...<br>In a sudden twist of fate, you\u2019re whisked away into another world and awaken aboard a mysterious train that never reaches its destination.<br>No driver. No passengers. Just an endless series of cars and a reality that grows more and more distorted.<br>You and two strangers from entirely different walks of life are tasked by the self-proclaimed \u201cmaster\u201d of the train, Konial, to investigate the bizarre anomalies that haunt its cars.<br>As you search deeper, tangled emotions and desires begin to surface, revealing the train's true purpose\u2026<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Characters</h2><br><strong>Reina Takahashi</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/e22f8112583f737471c84b22cc342afd.poster.avif?t=1768888574\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/e22f8112583f737471c84b22cc342afd.webm?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/e22f8112583f737471c84b22cc342afd.mp4?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A composed, level-headed office worker your age. Reina keeps the group grounded and quietly supports everyone\u2019s morale.<br><br><strong>Mai Asakura</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/f9a3bace1130a434e807735444a1dab9.poster.avif?t=1768888574\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/f9a3bace1130a434e807735444a1dab9.webm?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/f9a3bace1130a434e807735444a1dab9.mp4?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A cheerful, bright-eyed gal who\u2019s quick to break tension with her smile. She may seem carefree, but when it matters most, her resolve is unshakable.<br><br><strong>Konial</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/a18b021f58e69ae7999515c7cc03550f.poster.avif?t=1768888574\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/a18b021f58e69ae7999515c7cc03550f.webm?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/a18b021f58e69ae7999515c7cc03550f.mp4?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The playful and domineering self-proclaimed master of the train. She hides motives no one can guess and seems to have taken a special interest in you.<br><br><strong>Pazuzu</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/6c436ec19f837bb00fadf1c16ee75039.poster.avif?t=1768888574\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/6c436ec19f837bb00fadf1c16ee75039.webm?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/6c436ec19f837bb00fadf1c16ee75039.mp4?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>A timid yet justice-driven angel who infiltrated the train to expose Konial\u2019s crimes. Her gentle demeanor masks a side of her that few would ever suspect.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/2343d23570ec4a68ebb04f57ccb74a89.poster.avif?t=1768888574\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/2343d23570ec4a68ebb04f57ccb74a89.webm?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/2343d23570ec4a68ebb04f57ccb74a89.mp4?t=1768888574\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Gameplay</h2><strong>Anomaly Detection \u00d7 Train Exploration</strong><br>Move between cars to investigate strange anomalies that appear in each chapter. These phenomena drive the story forward and influence the emotions and bonds of your companions.<br><br><strong>Emotion System \u00d7 Multiple Endings</strong><br>Your choices and interactions will deepen your companions\u2019 feelings toward you, unlocking character events and branching endings. Relationships are the key to every outcome.<br><br><strong>Gear System \u00d7 Streamlined Exploration</strong><br>Collect items and raise affinity to exchange for special equipment that boosts your perception and investigation speed. In the later chapters, unlock new features to access hidden routes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3711590/extras/d9fa824ef3e38c4748ef9170f6f5c131.avif?t=1768888574\" width=1560 height=880 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 female characters to pursue<br></li><li> More than 40 CG H-scenes<br></li><li> Full Japanese voice acting</li></ul><s